    <li><a href="https://en.namu.wiki/w/%EC%A0%9C3%EC%B0%A8%20%EC%8A%88%ED%8D%BC%EB%A1%9C%EB%B4%87%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84/%EA%B3%B5%EB%9E%B5" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Namu Wiki — The 3rd Super Robot Wars / Strategy</a>（剧本表与隐藏要素交叉核对）</li>
